+- duplicates after rises: [-1, 0, 0, -1, 3, 3]
+
+Exhaustive family:
+- every list of length 0 through 6 over the alphabet {-3, -1, 0, 1, 3}
+- 19,531 inputs
+
+Generated family:
+- 2,000 lists
+- deterministic seed 0x9A11D17
+- lengths 0 through 30
+- elements uniformly selected from [-1,000,000,000, 1,000,000,000]
+
+Oracles and checks:
+- imports /reference/canonical.py:rolling_max
