+| `For(Name,Name,body)` | syntax `semantic.k:19,57-59`; rules 33-37 (but target proof preempts them with rule 48) |
+| `If` | syntax `semantic.k:20,53`; rules 28-30 |
+| `Compare(...,">",...)` | syntax `semantic.k:32,37-38,54-55`; rules 25-27 |
