Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The Python solution is correct and all reconstructed claims print `#Top`, but `verification.k` bypasses the real loop with an unsound, result-bearing rule. Concrete witnesses show it fabricates an impossible environment and mishandles continuations.

Detailed seven-stage report: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Preserved scripts and logs: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence/)
